<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Davids yr net up to A$51.8 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Davids yr net up to A$51.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				  51.8 vs 46.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Davids Ltd is a grocery wholesaler and retailer.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		   79.29  vs   68.14</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    5.0   vs    5.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	   10.0   vs   10.0</p>
<p>    Sales				3917.66  vs 3231.91</p>
<p>    Other income			152.97  vs   81.76</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  14.81  vs   15.01</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		     nil    vs    1.03 gain</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date October 18</p>
<p>Reg date October 3</p>
<p>    Tax				    26.88  vs   22.84</p>
<p>    Interest			     25.58  vs   18.05</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 25.51  vs   18.09</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
